    <decisions>
        <description>Only creates Contact Roles when the original Opportunity had at least one.</description>
        <name>Contact_Roles_To_Copy</name>
        <label>Contact Roles to Copy?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>None</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Has_Contact_Roles</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>varContactRolesToCreate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsEmpty</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Create_Renewal_Contact_Roles</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Has Contact Roles</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>Only continues when at least one Asset was found for the Order.</description>
        <name>Assets_Found</name>
        <label>Assets Found?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No Assets</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Has_Assets</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>varAssetIds</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsEmpty</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Create_Renewal_Quote</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Has Assets</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>Checks that Create Renewal Quote succeeded and returned a renewal quote.</description>
        <name>Renewal_Created</name>
        <label>Renewal Created?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Set_Renewal_Error</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Failed</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Created</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>varRenewalSuccess</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>varRenewalQuoteId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsBlank</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Renewal_Quote</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Created</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>Only continues for an Order from a Subscription New Opportunity that the Closed Won automation completed and that doesn&apos;t have a Renewal Opportunity yet. Orders from renewal or amendment quotes, and manual Orders, are skipped.</description>
        <name>Source_Opportunity_Found</name>
        <label>Source Opportunity Found?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Skip</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Found</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Source_Opportunity.Id</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Order_Items</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Found</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Runs asynchronously when Assets Created is checked on an Order that came from a Quote (Create Asset Order Event - Mark Order Assets Created checks it once Revenue Cloud has created the Order&apos;s Assets). If the Order came from a Subscription New Opportunity that the Closed Won Revenue Automation completed, and that Opportunity has no Renewal Opportunity yet, finds the Assets created from the Order&apos;s products (Order Product &gt; Asset Action Source &gt; Asset Action &gt; Asset) sets Renewal Term and Renewal Term Unit on those Assets from the Order&apos;s Product Selling Model where they are blank (Create Renewal Quote requires them and assetization leaves them blank), and drops any Asset that is a bundle component of another Asset (Asset Relationship), because Create Renewal Quote only accepts top-level Assets. It then calls the native Create Renewal Quote flow once with the top-level Assets, which creates the renewal Opportunity and renewal Quote. The new Opportunity is set to the Subscription Renewal record type, renamed &quot;&lt;original name&gt; - Renewal&quot;, given Type Existing Business, the original Owner and the Contract, and linked both ways (Previous Opportunity on the renewal, Renewal Opportunity on the original). The original Opportunity&apos;s Contact Roles (Contact, Role and Primary) are then copied to the renewal Opportunity. Errors are written to Closed Won Automation Error on the original Opportunity and sent through the Fault Path Subflow. Only runs when Run Flows is checked on the On/Off Switch custom setting.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>The current Order Product&apos;s Product Selling Model, or the one already found if this line has none.</description>
        <name>formSellingModelId</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>BLANKVALUE( {!Loop_Order_Items.ProductSellingModelId}, {!varSellingModelId} )</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>The renewal Opportunity name: the original Opportunity name followed by &quot; - Renewal&quot;, cut to the 120-character limit.</description>
        <name>formRenewalName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>LEFT( {!Get_Source_Opportunity.Name} &amp; &quot; - Renewal&quot;, 120 )</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Error message when Create Renewal Quote doesn&apos;t create the renewal quote.</description>
        <name>formRenewalErrorMessage</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Closed Won automation: Create Renewal Quote failed for Order &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Id} &amp; &quot;. &quot; &amp; {!varErrorMessage}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Order - Assets Created - Create Renewal {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Order - Assets Created - Create Renewal</label>
    <loops>
        <description>Goes through each Contact Role on the original Opportunity.</description>
        <name>Loop_Source_Contact_Roles</name>
        <label>Loop Source Contact Roles</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <collectionReference>Get_Source_Contact_Roles</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector>
            <targetReference>Add_Renewal_Contact_Role</targetReference>
        </nextValueConnector>
        <noMoreValuesConnector>
            <targetReference>Contact_Roles_To_Copy</targetReference>
        </noMoreValuesConnector>
    </loops>
    <loops>
        <description>Goes through each bundle component Asset so it can be removed from the list.</description>
        <name>Loop_Bundle_Components</name>
        <label>Loop Bundle Components</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <collectionReference>Get_Bundle_Components</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector>
            <targetReference>Remove_Bundle_Component</targetReference>
        </nextValueConnector>
        <noMoreValuesConnector>
            <targetReference>Assets_Found</targetReference>
        </noMoreValuesConnector>
    </loops>
    <loops>
        <description>Collects the Asset Id from each Asset Action.</description>
        <name>Loop_Asset_Actions</name>
        <label>Loop Asset Actions</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <collectionReference>Get_Asset_Actions</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector>
            <targetReference>Add_Asset_Id</targetReference>
        </nextValueConnector>
        <noMoreValuesConnector>
            <targetReference>Get_Selling_Model</targetReference>
        </noMoreValuesConnector>
    </loops>
    <loops>
        <description>Collects the Asset Action Id from each Asset Action Source.</description>
        <name>Loop_Asset_Action_Sources</name>
        <label>Loop Asset Action Sources</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <collectionReference>Get_Asset_Action_Sources</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector>
            <targetReference>Add_Asset_Action_Id</targetReference>
        </nextValueConnector>
        <noMoreValuesConnector>
            <targetReference>Get_Asset_Actions</targetReference>
        </noMoreValuesConnector>
    </loops>
    <loops>
        <description>Collects the Id of each Order Product.</description>
        <name>Loop_Order_Items</name>
        <label>Loop Order Items</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <collectionReference>Get_Order_Items</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector>
            <targetReference>Add_Order_Item_Id</targetReference>
        </nextValueConnector>
        <noMoreValuesConnector>
            <targetReference>Get_Asset_Action_Sources</targetReference>
        </noMoreValuesConnector>
    </loops>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
        <description>Creates the copied Contact Roles on the renewal Opportunity in one step.</description>
        <name>Create_Renewal_Contact_Roles</name>
        <label>Create Renewal Contact Roles</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <faultConnector>
            <targetReference>Handle_Fault</targetReference>
        </faultConnector>
        <inputReference>varContactRolesToCreate</inputReference>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordLookups>
        <description>Gets the Contact Roles on the original Opportunity so they can be copied to the renewal Opportunity.</description>
        <name>Get_Source_Contact_Roles</name>
        <label>Get Source Contact Roles</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Loop_Source_Contact_Roles</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <faultConnector>
            <targetReference>Handle_Fault</targetReference>
        </faultConnector>
