        <description>Gets the Asset Relationships where one of the Order&apos;s Assets is a bundle component (the Related Asset) of another Asset. Revenue Cloud stores bundle structure here; Asset.ParentId is left blank.</description>
        <name>Get_Bundle_Components</name>
